339 0 obj
<<
/A 1388 0 R
/Alt (Scientific infographic divided into four panels labeled A to D. Panel A shows a detailed diagram of the native osteocyte niche, labeling unmineralized and mineralized collagen, osteocyte, lacuna, canaliculi, and highlighting fluid flow. Panel B summarizes achievements of existing models, with illustrations for mineralization, patterning, flow/loading, and multicellular interactions. Panel C lists current challenges, using warning symbols and simplified diagrams to show mismatches such as mineralization without network and limited extracellular matrix \(ECM\)-cell correlation. Panel D proposes future directions with a 3D engineered niche illustration, referencing co-engineered mineralized ECM, network topology, transport and mechanics, cross-correlation characterization, modular perturbation, and computational integration.)
/K [28 1389 0 R]
/P 76 0 R
/Pg 37 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 1)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
