354 0 obj
<<
/A 1401 0 R
/Alt (Panel A presents diagrams and microscopy images depicting a bioinspired PILP mineralization method for hydrogel-collagen matrices, showing mineral crystals formation and SEM BSE micrographs of mineralized samples. Fluorescent and SEM images illustrate cell labeling for nuclei, F-actin, CaP, osteocalcin, and DMP1. Panel B displays confocal reconstructions and time-lapse imaging of MLO-Y4 cell networks stained for actin and nuclei, alongside a fluid flow experimental setup and intensity plots. Panel C compares low versus high molecular weight hydrogel structures, with schematics, bar graphs for elastic modulus and relaxation time, and confocal images of GFP-labeled nuclei under different relaxation conditions. Panel D shows FIB-SEM rendered images highlighting green canaliculi and brown Haversian canal, with red arrows marking distances from canalicular and osteon surfaces in micrographs.)
/K [11 1402 0 R]
/P 81 0 R
/Pg 38 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 2)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
